# PRIVATE (미방송분). Gyeongho's viewfinder overlay (1998 tape): corners, REC lamp, battery, timecode, 8% scanlines.
# Timecode digits are a sample; draw them at runtime with the 3x5 font in mbs_ui_font.
@palette ../palette/ui.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../fx/mbs_fx_viewfinder.png
@preview ../previews/mbs_fx_viewfinder_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame rec

